  "translations": [
    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "据说二战以后再也没有爆发世界规模的大战，正是因为核武器的诞生。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 93,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_REFERENCE_CLIPPED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "一旦开战，对方可能会发射核武器。想到这一点，就不能轻易发动武力冲突。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 102,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_REFERENCE_PARTIAL"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "尤其自从<R=洲际弹道导弹,ICBM>出现以后，无论身在何处都无法安心。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=洲际弹道导弹,ICBM>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 90,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED;AUX_OMITS_ANYWHERE_UNSAFE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "相应地，军费也膨胀了不少……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 42,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "为了不遭到先发制人的攻击，只能向对方展示自己的核力量。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 81,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "也正因如此，核武器的威力得到了飞跃式提升。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 63,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_SHIFTED_REFERENCE_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "不只是破坏力，连精确命中遥远目标的技术也一样。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 69,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "太空开发竞赛同时也是对这种技术的展示。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 57,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "结果就是<R=相互保证毁灭,MAD>吗。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=相互保证毁灭,MAD>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 44,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "这是核威慑的终极形态。只要知道发射后会遭到反击、导致自身毁灭，就没人会动用核武器。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 123,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "……可不好说。也不能排除有人误按核按钮的可能性。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 72,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    }
  ]
}
